   "unit_id": "unit-1760f718e9d244e393c0fae4a8446702",
   "title": "Memory leak reproduction",
   "summary_sentences": [
    {
     "text": "The user reports that the ws-gateway service leaks memory at about 40 MB per hour, causing OOM restarts every two days.",
     "source_spans": [
      {
       "turn_id": "synth-c2-t000",
       "char_start": 86,
       "char_end": 140
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "The assistant sets up a local reproduction with a churn load test of 500 concurrent clients.",
     "source_spans": [
      {
       "turn_id": "synth-c2-t003",
       "char_start": 148,
       "char_end": 242
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "After five minutes, heapUsed grows by over 200 MB and the heap diff reveals over 14,000 leaked WebSocket objects.",
     "source_spans": [
      {
       "turn_id": "synth-c2-t005",
       "char_start": 0,
       "char_end": 75
      },
      {
       "turn_id": "synth-c2-t007",
       "char_start": 0,
       "char_end": 83
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
   "covered_turns": [
    "synth-c2-t000",
    "synth-c2-t001",
    "synth-c2-t002",
    "synth-c2-t003",
    "synth-c2-t004",
    "synth-c2-t005",
    "synth-c2-t006",
    "synth-c2-t007"
   ],
   "salient_infos": [],
   "frozen": true,
   "created_at_turn": "synth-c2-t049"
  },
  {
   "unit_id": "unit-f78264145fd04b87b293fccdf5eb41be",
   "title": "Investigate listener leak…",
   "summary_sentences": [
    {
     "text": "The user suspects listener leaks, and the assistant inventories every .on()/.addListener() registration.",
     "source_spans": [
      {
       "turn_id": "synth-c2-t009",
       "char_start": 60,
       "char_end": 122
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Instrumentation of shared emitters shows flat listener counts over 10 minutes and no MaxListenersExceededWarning is found.",
     "source_spans": [
      {
       "turn_id": "synth-c2-t014",
       "char_start": 347,
       "char_end": 428
      },
      {
       "turn_id": "synth-c2-t017",
       "char_start": 405,
       "char_end": 426
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "The listener theory is parked as a dead end.",
     "source_spans": [
      {
       "turn_id": "synth-c2-t018",
       "char_start": 205,
       "char_end": 264
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
   "covered_turns": [
