   "title": "Incident documentation wrap‑up",
   "summary_sentences": [
    {
     "text": "The assistant writes an incident summary detailing the two root causes — the unbounded messageCache and the heartbeat’s per‑tick pong listener and uncleared interval — and the fixes.",
